# Root env (optional). Load order for API dev/start/scripts:
#   apps/api/.env  →  .env (this, copied)  →  .env.local (written by `neon init`)
# Later files override earlier ones; variables already set in the shell/host always win.
# Keep lines commented unless you need them: an empty `KEY=` here overrides apps/api/.env.
# Never commit real values. Vitest and Playwright never read these files.

# Neon pooled URL (host contains "-pooler"): used by the running API.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://<user>:<password>@<endpoint>-pooler.<region>.aws.neon.tech/<db>?sslmode=require
# Neon direct URL: used only by `pnpm neon:migrate` / render:start for `prisma migrate deploy`.
# DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED=postgresql://<user>:<password>@<endpoint>.<region>.aws.neon.tech/<db>?sslmode=require

# SESSION_SECRET=<32+ random chars>
# APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
# password (default) | social
# AUTH_MODE=password
